  "title": "Vendor Load-In Checklist Form",
  "subtitle": "Verify venue readiness before arrival, observe the active load-in, and release each affected area only after completion checks.",
  "description": "An original readiness and execution checklist that verifies the issued load-in order, dock and route conditions, receiving resources, arrival controls, observed exceptions, area restoration, and accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use on the operating day as the venue lead walks the arrival route before the vendor enters, monitors unloading and internal movement, records failed checks, and releases the route and staging areas after completion.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
